          %p
            More generally, an analogous statement applies to suitable
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+bundles"} fiber bundles
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Oka+manifolds"} Oka manifolds
            over
